{"id":"H5970","lemma":"עָלַץ","transliteration":"alats","sayIt":"a-LATS","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"verb","gloss":"to rejoice","meaning":"1) to rejoice, exult\n1a) (Qal) to exult","glosses":["exult","rejoice","in","may rejoice","rejoices","triumph"],"count":8,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1sa-2","v":1,"renderings":{"bsb":"in","kjv":"rejoiceth"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-16","v":32,"renderings":{"bsb":"exult","kjv":"rejoice"}},{"chapterId":"psa-5","v":11,"renderings":{"bsb":"may rejoice"}},{"chapterId":"psa-9","v":2,"renderings":{"bsb":"and rejoice","kjv":"and rejoice"}},{"chapterId":"psa-25","v":2,"renderings":{"bsb":"exult"}},{"chapterId":"psa-68","v":3,"renderings":{"bsb":"and rejoice","kjv":"let them rejoice"}},{"chapterId":"pro-11","v":10,"renderings":{"bsb":"rejoices","kjv":"rejoiceth"}},{"chapterId":"pro-28","v":12,"renderings":{"bsb":"triumph","kjv":"men do rejoice"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Samuel 2:1","note":"Hannah prayed, and said: “My heart exults in Yahweh! My horn is exalted in Yahweh. My mouth is enlarged over my enemies, because I rejoice in your salvation.","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 16:32","note":"Let the sea roar, and its fullness! Let the field exult, and all that is in it!","source":"web"},{"ref":"Psalm 5:11","note":"But let all those who take refuge in you rejoice. Let them always shout for joy, because you defend them. Let them also who love your name be joyful in you.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Proverbs 11:10","note":"When it goes well with the righteous, the city rejoices. When the wicked perish, there is shouting.","source":"web"}],"related":[],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}